  // Notes:
  model notes ```
# Hydrochlorothiazide (HCTZ) body model

Physiologically based pharmacokinetic/pharmacodynamic (PBPK/PD) model ofhydrochlorothiazide,
built with the PBPK library `pkpdsim.pbpk`: the wholebody with the absorption of HCTZ in the
intestine, its distribution intothe tissues and its renal excretion by filtration
and tubular secretion,and the fluid and electrolyte model of the PD (`FLUID`) with the
effect ofHCTZ on the excretion of sodium and chloride and the blood pressure.

The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.

