the ages; times the aging of the adults: cardiac index at a fixed body surface area:
1 - 0.0030 \* (age - 35) (cardiovascular magnetic resonance of Carlsson 2012, -0.21
to -0.29 % per year; the three-dimensional echocardiography of Patel 2021 about -0.25
