  FLUID__counter_gamma notes "Counter-regulation feedback."
  FLUID__f_h2o_max notes ```
The urine is at most this fraction of the filtration, the rest ofthe filtered water
is reabsorbed. Without the limit an expandedextracellular fluid (twice its reference)
with HCTZ excretes morewater than is filtered: the reabsorption of water and sodium
turnsnegative and the integration fails. Within the supported domain thefractional
excretion of water stays below 0.09, the limit is notreached.
```
  FLUID__E50_hctz_nacl notes "E50 for HCTZ effect on sodium and chloride excretion."
  FLUID__Emax_hctz_na notes "Emax for HCTZ effect on sodium excretion."
  FLUID__Emax_hctz_cl notes "Emax for HCTZ effect on chloride excretion."
  KI__HCTZUP notes ```
Basolateral influx between the cell and the interstitium on the unbound concentration
`fu_hctz / K_int_pls_hctz * Cis_hctz`.
